---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Acuitix – Secure Online Exams | A SynVoke Product"
    description="Acuitix is SynVoke's enterprise-grade secure examination platform. AI proctoring, real-time analytics, and tamper-proof assessment delivery for institutions at scale."
    url="https://synvoke.tech/acuitix"
>
    <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50">

        <!-- Nav -->
        <nav class="w-full px-6 py-5 flex justify-between items-center border-b border-gray-100 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-50">
            <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium transition-colors text-sm">
                ← SynVoke
            </a>
            <a
                href="https://acuitix.com"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm"
            >
                Visit Acuitix ↗
            </a>
        </nav>

        <!-- Hero -->
        <section class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-24 max-w-5xl">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">
                    A SynVoke Product
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-none mb-3">
                    Acuitix
                </h1>
                <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-indigo-600 font-medium mb-8">Secure Online Exams</p>
                <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-10">
                    Acuitix is SynVoke's flagship secure online examination platform — built for institutions that demand zero-compromise integrity.
                    AI-powered proctoring, real-time analytics, and enterprise-grade assessment delivery at any scale.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                    <a
                        href="https://acuitix.com"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-800 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-semibold transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg"
                    >
                        Go to Acuitix ↗
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="/#work"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-900 text-gray-700 hover:text-gray-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-semibold transition-all"
                    >
                        See All Work
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Product image -->
        <section class="bg-gray-900 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-5xl">
                <img
                    src="/images/exam_portal.png"
                    alt="Acuitix secure exam platform interface"
                    class="w-full rounded-t-2xl shadow-2xl mt-12"
                />
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Features -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-5xl">
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
                    Built for trust.<br/><span class="text-gray-400 italic">Engineered for scale.</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 mb-16 max-w-xl">
                    Every feature in Acuitix is designed around one principle: assessment integrity that institutions and students can rely on.
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                    <div class="p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 text-indigo-600 text-lg">🛡</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">AI-Powered Proctoring</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Real-time facial recognition, tab-switch detection, and behavioural analysis ensure exam integrity without invasive hardware.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 text-indigo-600 text-lg">👥</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Student & Admin Portals</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Dedicated, role-separated interfaces for students and administrators — purpose-built for clarity at every step of the exam lifecycle.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 text-indigo-600 text-lg">📊</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Real-Time Analytics</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Live dashboards surface completion rates, flag anomalies, and generate audit-ready reports the moment an exam ends.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 text-indigo-600 text-lg">⚡</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Enterprise-Scale Delivery</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Socket-synchronized exam state across thousands of concurrent sessions, with zero data loss and sub-second result propagation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Stack -->
        <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-5xl">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Architecture & Stack</h3>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    {["React", "Firebase", "Node.js", "WebRTC", "Socket.io", "AI Proctoring"].map((tech) => (
                        <span class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-900 hover:text-white hover:border-gray-900 transition-colors cursor-default">
                            {tech}
                        </span>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-gray-900">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-5xl text-center">
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
                    Ready to run<br/><span class="text-indigo-400">secure exams?</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
                    Acuitix is live at acuitix.com. Contact SynVoke to onboard your institution or get a custom enterprise deployment.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                    <a
                        href="https://acuitix.com"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-semibold transition-all shadow-lg"
                    >
                        Visit Acuitix ↗
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="/#contact"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-semibold transition-all"
                    >
                        Talk to SynVoke
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="bg-gray-950 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
            <p>
                &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">SynVoke</a>.
                Acuitix is a SynVoke product. &nbsp;·&nbsp;
                <a href="https://acuitix.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">acuitix.com</a>
            </p>
        </footer>
    </main>
</Layout>
